EstablishmentDetail.RightToReply:
&lt;div&gt;
	The establishment has been thoroughly cleaned and procedures are in place to ensure that&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
	cleanliness is maintained,The establishment has been or will shortly be fully renovated,A new management system has been implemented,The staff have been trained/re-trained/given instruction/are under revised supervisory&amp;nbsp;arrangements. Taps is replaced, Decorated, Roof repaired, Equipments cleaned. We are having deep cleaning on the day EHO visted and there are alots things on the day that are not our routine. And we just had a bad day.&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
	The staff have been trained/re-trained/given instruction/are under revised supervisory arrangements. The establishment has been thoroughly cleaned and procedures are in place to ensure that cleanliness is maintained.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	Before Hot water was not working due to some mechanical issue now it&amp;#39;s working&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	The conditions found at the time of the inspection were not typical of the normal conditions maintained at the establishment. The issues identified were temporary and occurred due to exceptional operational circumstances on the day. These matters have since been fully addressed, staff have been trained in food hygiene standards, and normal generally satisfactory hygiene conditions are consistently maintained at the premises.&lt;/p&gt;
